{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/853040/extras/9e304f40909be5449ca366de9141ca2a.avif?t=1760077706\" width=1280 height=720 /></span>What is <strong>Deep Space Rush</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Space Rush</strong> - a  game from BUG-Studio representing hardcore-endless Sci-fi platformer, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >which generates new levels on the go! Each new level will not be like the past!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/853040/extras/4d789c161fe9f17440441546242cc9c4.avif?t=1760077706\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/853040/extras_big/4d789c161fe9f17440441546242cc9c4.webp?t=1760077706 width=1560 height=878 /></span>What's the game about? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are one of the members of the <strong>DeTeam</strong> team, which controls the safety of scientific stations, which are various experiments of scientists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If there was a leak of the virus and everyone at the station got infected, it's your time! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your gun, jump into the spaceship and go to a new sweep!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful... The <strong>DeTeam</strong> team is top secret! If you die, no one will remember you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/853040/extras/1a4e61a8ec85479bfbb79fc8d44c07eb.avif?t=1760077706\" width=549 height=286 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fully generated levels, traps, monsters! It will be fun, interesting and challenging!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Ability to buy and pump guns and improvements!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dynamic and challenging gameplay! Are you sure you can?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dynamic soundtrack by HateBit! Turn it up!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"10 Zones","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/853040/4d9adc51ac33d547f24300e0b92c4788de47e3f7.jpg"},{"name":"25 Zones","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/853040/4d9adc51ac33d547f24300e0b92c4788de47e3f7.jpg"},{"name":"50 Zones","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/853040/7cb296a96e470af833dbed0c34719987cac50356.jpg"},{"name":"10 Monsters","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/853040/7cb296a96e470af833dbed0c34719987cac50356.jpg"},{"name":"20 Monsters","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/853040/4d9adc51ac33d547f24300e0b92c4788de47e3f7.jpg"},{"name":"30 Monsters","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/853040/4d9adc51ac33d547f24300e0b92c4788de47e3f7.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/853040?t=1760077706","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/853040/eed2b74951c7a0b3772deb5e9ab1a84e6158a3bc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760077706","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/853040/1343849a726651ec5a937303341b61ada4195bc5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760077706","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/853040/1343849a726651ec5a937303341b61ada4195bc5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760077706","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sh